<h1>Hritikaaa</h1>
<div class="script">The love of my life</div>
<p>
I wanted to make you something you could return to whenever you feel like
being reminded of how loved, admired, appreciated and important you are to me.
</p>
<p>
I love you so much. I want to keep loving you, learning you, choosing you
and building a beautiful life with you.
</p>
<a class="btn" href="#apology">Come inside, my love</a>
